  "question": {
    "text": "The correct relationships between unit cell edge length &lsquo;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></math>&rsquo; and radius of sphere &lsquo;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></math>&rsquo; for face-centred and body-centred cubic structures respectively are:"
